#. module: hr_rfid
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_rfid.field_hr_rfid_ctrl_alarm_group__name
msgid ""
"Enter a descriptive name for this alarm group (e.g., 'First Floor Alarms', "
"'Warehouse Security', 'Office Area'). Groups help you manage multiple alarms"
